s\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 32 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nShraddha Elite is an exquisite blend of traditional luxury and modern design, making it a standout presence in its vibrant Mumbai surroundings. With a striking architectural style characterized by solid masses, sharp edges, and expansive glass facades, this residential marvel towers gracefully into the skyline. The grandeur of the building is evident from the moment you enter the impressive double-height lobby, setting the tone for the exclusive lifestyle that awaits within.  \n  \nEach apartment in Shraddha Elite is thoughtfully designed to offer spectacular views of the bustling city, bringing a sense of the outside world right into your living space. With ample natural light and ventilation, every home provides a serene escape amidst the energetic atmosphere of Mumbai. The interiors reflect sophistication and elegance, making it an ideal choice for discerning homeowners seeking both comfort and style.  \n  \nBeyond its luxurious apartments, Shraddha Elite prioritizes the well-being and security of its residents, creating a peaceful sanctuary within the urban landscape. This project represents not just a home, but a lifestyle of unparalleled exclusivity and refinement, where every detail speaks to quality and sophistication.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Shraddha Elite Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Shraddha Elite in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 812223](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/102136/BHK_Configuration/2-bhk-708-1727192435.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n708 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.05 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Shraddha Elite in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 812224](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/102136/BHK_Configuration/3-bhk-868-1727192469.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n868 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.52 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Shraddha Elite in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 812225](ht