erty-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shraddha-developers-shraddha-elite-elevation-1684750943.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300323040623-newproject-2023-03-30t160558968.webp)\n\n# Shraddha Elite\n\nShraddha Elite Meenant CHS. Ltd., Kosamgo Nagar, Sumer Nagar Jain Mandir Road, off S V Road, Borivali West, Western Suburbs, Mumbai\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹2.54 Cr\n\n₹2.54 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nShraddha Elite Meenant CHS. Ltd., located in Kosamgo Nagar, Sumer Nagar Jain Mandir Road, off S V Road, Borivali West, Western Suburbs, Mumbai, is an exclusive residential project that embodies elegance and luxury. This prestigious development offers a harmonious blend of modern design and thoughtful amenities. Comprising of spacious 3 BHK apartments, the project caters to the discerning tastes of urban dwellers seeking comfort and style. The strategic location provides convenient access to essential facilities and transportation links, making it an ideal choice for professionals and families alike. With meticulous craftsmanship and a commitment to quality, Shraddha Elite Meenant CHS. Ltd. promises a remarkable living experience in one of Mumbai's most sought-after neighbourhoods.\n\nConfiguration\n\n3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2025\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹29,262/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n868 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Luxurious apartments featuring exquisite interiors and surrounded by natural beauty\n* Impeccably maintained and beautifully landscaped gardens\n* Lavish apartments offering a wide range of splendid amenitie\n\n* Excellent connectivity to major rail and road transportation networks\n* Serene and peaceful environment for a tranquil living experience\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nTransportation Access: Residents frequently highlight the excellent connectivity provided by the nearby Borivali Railway Station and the Metro network. Proximity to Essentials: The location is highly rated for having schools, hospitals, and local markets within a short walkable distance. Neighborhood Environment: Many reviews describe the area as a peaceful and vibrant community with a cultural balance due to nearby landmarks like Ganpati Mandir. Property Value: Feedback indicates that while property and rental rates are high, the project offers a luxurious lifestyle that reflects the premium nature of Borivali West.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nStrategic Connectivity\n\nThe project is situated very close to S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway for easy commuting.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nResidents have access to a wide range of facilities including a rooftop lounge, gymnasium, and specialized sports areas like a cricket net.\n\nSafety Standards\n\nThe locality is considered safe for families with active CCTV surveillance and regular security patrolling.\n\nInfrastructure Quality\n\nThe construction uses modern technology like Mivan formwork and features high floor-to-ceiling heights.\n\nUtility Reliability\n\nMost residents report a consistent water supply and well-maintained street lighting in the immediate vicinity.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nStrategic Connectivity\n\nThe project is situated very close to S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway for easy commuting.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nResidents have access to a wide range of facilities including a rooftop lounge, gymnasium, and specialized sports areas like a cricket net.\n\nSafety Standards\n\nThe locality is considered safe for families with active CCTV surveillance and regular security patrolling.\n\nInfrastructure Quality\n\nThe construction uses modern technology like Mivan formwork and features high floor-to-ceiling heights.\n\nUtility Reliability\n\nMost residents report a consistent water supply and well-maintained street lighting in the immediate vicinity.\n\nPeak Hour Congestion\n\nPublic transport including buses and trains can become extremely overcrowded during rush hours.\n\nHigh Cost of Living\n\nThe premium location results in high maintenance and property rates that may be unaffordable for some.\n\nLimited Greenery\n\nSome feedback points to a lack of significant open green spaces or large parks within the immediate project footprint.\n\nMonsoon Issues\n\nCertain surrounding roads are prone to waterlogging and becoming damp during heavy rainfall periods.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nThere have been occasional mentions of limited space for visitor parking and open play areas.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nExcellent for rail commuters\n\nPremium lifestyle choice\n\nHigh entry cost\n\nIdeal for urban convenience\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n3 BHK\n\n* ## 8