condary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Shraddha Elite is 31 Dec 2025\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Shraddha Elite is 868 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Shraddha Elite is ₹2.54 Cr Onwards\n\n### Where is Shraddha Elite located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nShraddha Elite is located at Shraddha Elite Meenant CHS. Ltd., Kosamgo Nagar, Sumer Nagar Jain Mandir Road, off S V Road, Borivali West, Western Suburbs, Mumbai.\n\n### What configurations are available in Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nShraddha Elite has 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Shraddha Elite is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Shraddha Elite?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Shraddha Elite is Shraddha Developers.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Shraddha Elite:Shraddha Developers](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300323040623-newproject-2023-03-30t160558968.webp)\n\n## Shraddha Developers\n\nShraddha Developers is an emerging real estate company in Mumbai that is experiencing rapid growth while maintaining high standards. With a strong determination to establish a prominent position in the industry, the company prioritizes customer satisfaction above all. By consistently delivering exceptional projects, it aims to set new benchmarks in the real estate sector. Operating with transparency, Shraddha Developers strives to surpass customer expectations by offering projects with superior amenities, excellent value for money, and a deep sense of contentment for its customers.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/konark-developer-konark-32-west-view-elevation-1779782095.webp)\n\n![Konark 32 West View](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150923041604-newproject-3.webp)\n\nKonark 32 West View\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.35 Cr - 7.71 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4.5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dotom-realty-dotom-vue-elevation-1747896338.jpg)\n\n![Dotom Vue](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/111125030803-dotommvlogo.webp)\n\nDotom Vue\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dgs-group-builders-dgs-sheetal-shashank-elevation-1754035295.jpg)\n\n![DGS Sheetal Shashank](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/230822105140-newproject-2022-08-23t105040950.png)\n\nDGS Sheetal Shashank\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.05 Cr - 1.77 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-1747641591.jpg)\n\n![Paradigm Anantaara](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/201221111027-PARADIGM.png)\n\nParadigm Anantaara\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹2.28 Cr - 3.71 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper