he lively worldthat is Mumbai. The views stretch unto the horizon, in each direction, that bring the outside world into your home. Each apartment across the stylish of light and ventilation. Your home is secur islet of peace & security.\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nShraddha Elite brochure\n\n## Pricing of Shraddha Elite\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [868 sqft](#tabs-2487)\n* [968 sqft](#tabs-2488)\n* [1029 sqft](#tabs-2489)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 868 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.08 Cr\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 968 sqft | Price:\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1029 sqft | Price:\n\n## Property Features of Shraddha Elite\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp) Jogging Track\n\n* ![Sports Courts](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nbOC3ahgBFfPoXp1KsSLitr2C30r6v4wsl5bP6X8.webp) Sports Courts\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/SFZjCUNkC7Mx0X3VU5OrVgx4mtJUvqfykBy0PZer.webp) Swimming Pool\n\n* ![Yoga Zone](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/COwM5RjENyf7U7nEW3taZHaXwLNwUKHFpeE88skI.webp) Yoga Zone\n\n* ![Gym](https://keystonerealestateadvi