 easy access to the entire Western line.\n\n**Borivali West Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\n* Borivali (West) Metro Station\n* Eksar Metro Station\n* Borivali Metro Station\n* Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Gokul Hotel Borivali (W) Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Borivali West**\n\n* Burger King\n* Borivali Biryani Centre ( Chikuwadi ) BBC\n* The Veg Treat II\n* Mexichino restaurant\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Borivali West**\n\n* St. Lawrence High School\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* ORCHIDS The International School - Borivali\n* VEDANT INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About Shraddha Group\n\n![Shraddha Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/2XjLQifSWbgTvNaK3AesDc21H85dWONaLyMGklcr.png)\n\n* Year Estd. 2003\n* [Projects - 4](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/shraddha-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Shraddha Group\n\nThe Shraddha Group, established in the year2003, embodies the values of \"Strength, Quality, Trust & Relationship.\" It is renowned for its reputation as the most innovativ\n\nread more\n\ne and forward-thinking real estate firm in Mumbai. While it initially focused on construction, the Shraddha Group has evolved into a modern and dynamic entity.\n\nread less\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Shraddha Elite\n\nWhat is the address of Shraddha Elite?\n\nThe Shraddh