rivali West for Shraddha Elite may vary depending on current government regulations. For the latest update connect with our sales team. [Call Now](tel:7045670457)\n\nWhat kind of amenities are available at Shraddha Elite Borivali West?\n\nThe Shraddha Elite project in Borivali West offers a wide range of lifestyle amenities, including a swimming pool, jogging track, gym, kids play area, multipurpose lawn, garden, senior citizen zone, and more.\n\nHow is the connectivity near Shraddha Elite Borivali West?\n\nStrategically located on in Borivali West, Shraddha Elite enjoys exceptional connectivity via roads, highways, and railways. The upcoming infrastructure makes it easier for daily travelers.\n\n## More Projects near Borivali West\n\n[![Kanakia Privaasa Borivali](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/4RphzHWuhW2a2f3IB9hok73cae5rUk2kHCfvYRL6.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/kanakia-privaasa-borivali-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8884) \n\n### [Kanakia Privaasa Borivali](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/kanakia-privaasa-borivali-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8884)\n\n##### by Kanakia Spaces Realty\n\n2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n[![Konark Zen Pristine](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/Mny9qMnM2iMeQhoZlo6N3w56YTXJvqsGCSA0gI9q.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/konark-zen-pristine-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8881) \n\n### [Konark Zen Pristine](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/konark-zen-pristine-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8881)\n\n##### by Konark Shakti Group\n\n2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 2.46 Cr - 4.01 Cr\n\n[![The lush Life code name](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/the-lush-life-code-name-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8855) \n\n### [The lush Life code name](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.c