e7/v6/thumb.jpg)\n![RR]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of Shreeji Skyrise](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/3b88ef31a27fd9d600791d267e0583d7/v0/medium/shreeji_skyrise-kandivali_west-mumbai-shreeji_sharan_group_of_companies.png)\n![](https://housing-images.n7net.in/0b8ad14c/ce0a797503c496bcaeae541f4d3c7b23/v0/thumb.jpeg)\n![Gallery Cover Pic of N Rose Northern Heights Phase 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/4549888c5b2c6e91e18a90f67168410f/v0/medium/n_rose_northern_heights_phase_1-dahisar_east-mumbai-n_rose_developers.jpeg)\n![IS]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of Harasiddh Manasarovar](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/01f67ab76befbc7aa15ca36815609d65/v0/medium/harasiddh_manasarovar-kandivali_west-mumbai-harasiddh_projects.jpeg)\n![ID]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of JE And VEE Shree Gopaldham](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/5292fb0e4fb4299d554ec50e0364da76/v0/medium/je_and_vee_shree_gopaldham-kandivali_west-mumbai-je%26vee_infrastructure.jpeg)\n![](https://housing-images.n7net.in/0b8ad14c/7c20d2e0253dd5742232883f530da72c/v4/thumb.jpg)\n![UC]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of MICL Aaradhya Highpark](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/9a869a16707520bb71504f292463d8c8/v0/medium/micl_aaradhya_highpark-mira_road_east-mumbai-man_infraconstruction_limited.jpeg)\n![](https://housing-images.n7net.in/0b8ad14c/3055b7fd181ae1539be9a1d3cc1b910a/v0/thumb.jpg)\n![PR]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of Mahindra Marina64 Phase 2](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/9bba7850537e5b2a066d0c90c191cc8d/v0/medium/mahindra_marina64_phase_2-malad_west-mumbai-mahindra_lifespaces.jpeg)\n![](https://housing-images.n7net.in/0b8ad14c/83b264a4667f291d3afe7be563c55a40/v1/thumb.jpg)\n![Gallery Cover Pic of JKD VIR Paradise](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/7fd2a3484f7217ea2b3947f4012525a3/v0/medium/jkd_vir_paradise-malad_west-mumbai-jkd_engineers_and_infrastructure_private_limited.jpeg)\n![DS]()\n![Gallery Cover Pic of Godrej Nest](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/c195ab2f8cc2a92800cb0630af6e4018/v0/medium/godrej_nest-kandivali_east-mumbai-godrej_properties_ltd.jpg)\n![](https://housing-images.n7net.in/0b8ad14c/3451d12dad1d16cba0ecb0361fc97e80/v1/thumb.jpg)\n\n## About Shraddha Elite\n\n## Shraddha Elite Floor Plans and Pricing\n\n## Shraddha Elite Photos & Videos\n\n![Shraddha Elite Project Tour 1](https://img.youtube.com/vi/gX0agAeNtUU/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Shraddha Elite More Images 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/8cccd7f225b063f6ae702a24e3a0c73d/v0/medium/shraddha_elite-borivali_west_1-mumbai-shraddha_developers_%26_realtors.jpeg)\n![Shraddha Elite Elevation 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/147d6f89286b21560158b5225e8a3a7b/v0/medium.jpeg)\n![Shraddha Elite Lobby 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/57178e0e6a80901d6d0adf699c668072/v0/medium.jpeg)\n\n## Shraddha Elite Top Amenities\n\n![]()\n\n## Shraddha Elite Specifications\n\n### Floor & Counter\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/floorCounterTab.65d21b4c.svg)\n\n### Fitting\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/fittingTab.01cbbe4c.svg)\n\n### Wall & Ceiling\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/wallsCeilingTab.31601368.svg)\n\n### Shraddha Elite Ratings & Reviews Borivali West 4.6/5\n\n## Shraddha Elite Ratings & Reviews\n\nNow you can see Rating & Review in one place for both Project & Locality!\n\n### Ratings based on features\n\n4.7/5\n\n4.6/5\n\n4.6/5\n\n4.6/5\n\n![]()\n\nLived before |  1 year ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\neverything is better than other places . near restaurant and school 🏫 , Hospital 🏥 traffic free arearead more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nnothing I loved this place. safety area safe road every people's and housenebar are very clever. nothing dislike about the placeread more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nThis locality is in close Proximity to Pepsi ground and Suvidha Bus stop, both within a 2 minute walkable distance. Essential amenities such as markets, school, hospitals, college and gyms are conveniently accessible within a 5 minute distance. Additionally, the metro station is situation 2 kilometre away, enhancing connectivity in the area.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nProperty and rental rates in Borivali West are high due to its connectivity and amenities, making it unaffordable for some residents.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nA Peaceful and vibrant neighborhood, perfect for those seeking a tranquil yet lively environment. Located just a short walk from renowned Ganpati Mandir, it offer the ideal balance of serenity and cultural vibrancy. Perfect for anyone looking for a vibrant yet peaceful place to call home.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThe place is too far from where i live, making it inconvenient to manage. The distance adds unnecessary travel time and effort in my daily routine.read more\n\n![]()\n\nLived before |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nThe area is safe because 24/7 CCTV surveillance,Security guards,police patrol often visit.The locality is well maintained And it is clean but in monsoon season the roads are very wet.There is no powercut and very less.But in sometimes streelights does not work which will make uncomfortable to walk in.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThere is not much space parking and open space for playing.There is not much greenery to feel fresh air.This us the negativity.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nBorivali Is very good area in Mumbai. The transportation is too easy to accessible from Metro or bus cabs or train. The roads are very clean and wide. There is no water shortage in this place Is very medium in the area And people should access many amenities nearby the place, and after 7 o’clock, the street lights are always on, and it was safe for everyoneread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThe dislikes of this place is like nothing, but sometimes the people face power cuts in the areas and the roads are very good, but in monsoon, it logged with water toread more\n\n29 Reviews\n\n## Price Trends for Shraddha Elite vs. Borivali West\n\n+\n\nADD MORE\n\nto compare\n\n## Property Registery Records of Shraddha Elite\n\nGovernment Registered Transactions & Property Rates\n\n### Recent Registries in Shraddha Elite\n\nData Source : Maharashtra Government\n\n| Date | Agreement Price | Area(sq.ft) | Rate/sq.ft | Flat & Floor No. | Tower | Transaction Type |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/279645) | 1,064 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 2501,  25th    Floor | - | sale |\n| 8 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/279645) | 1,064 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 2001,  20th    Floor | - | sale |\n| 8 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/279645) | 1,064 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 2901,  29th    Floor | - | sale |\n| 8 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/279645) | 1,090 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 402 | - | sale |\n| 8 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/279645) | 1,064 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 2401,  24th    Floor | - | sale |\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nLearn about new registry records in Shraddha Elite\n\n## Shraddha Elite Official Brochure\n\n![Shraddha Elite Brochure 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/32c44a183a676852052ca75b68937838/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Shraddha Elite Brochure 2](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/5be2378ec5ba93ab6708c49b619ae1f0/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Shraddha Elite Brochure 3](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/25ada69b371bcad93d27fb0462780089/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Shraddha Elite Brochure 4](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/fc1810c0eb3c9ee